c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p020","text":"初，匈奴好漢繒絮食物，中行說曰：「匈奴人眾不能當漢之一郡，然所以彊者，以衣食異，無仰於漢也。今單于變俗好漢物，漢物不過什二，則匈奴盡歸於漢矣。其得漢繒絮，以馳草棘中，衣袴皆裂敝，以示不如旃裘之完善也。得漢食物皆去之，以示不如湩酪之便美也。」於是說教單于左右疏記，以計課其人眾畜物。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"中行說","kind":"person","person_id":"e8g_59i_f6c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0122","start":122,"end":123,"surface":"說","kind":"person","person_id":"e8g_59i_f6c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"nzl_kzb_2qr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m020-0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-110","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","source":{"title":"史記／卷110","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷110","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷110&oldid=8735645","revision_id":8735645,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定數位見證去介面及現代節標題後61段，末段為太史公論。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去 header2 介面及現代單于節標題、太史公曰節標題；移除單字語言轉換包裹與下劃線標籤，紀年 YL 模板保留顯示原詞。其餘原字、標點及段落次序保留，不從小標題補正文人名。","note":"未核底本影像。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalize